## 3. Required R4 proofs

The fixture, validator and independent reviewer must demonstrate all of the
following without invoking `--actual`, Git, VCPToolBox, Host, plugin, runtime,
database, provider, private Memory, sensing or effect code:

1. the real inherited scanner source, after matching its declared SHA-256,
   loads successfully despite its `@dataclass`;
2. scanner bytes with a mismatched digest do not execute top-level code;
3. the fixed scanner module name is absent before loading and absent after a
   successful or failed load;
4. a pre-existing module-name collision fails closed without replacing or
   deleting the pre-existing caller module; and
5. a scanner that replaces its own `sys.modules[__name__]` entry is rejected
   and leaves no R4 scanner module mapping behind.

## 4. Stop rule

R4 stops at
`PHASE_5D_M0D_ACTUAL_OBJECT_ONLY_SOURCE_RUN_DECISION_PACKAGE_R4_FRESH_FULL_ATOMIC_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW`.
It cannot accept, freeze, re-run `--actual`, create a worktree, invoke Host,
or perform Git delivery.
